<title>HONG KONG: TENNIS-HONG KONG OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-HONG KONG OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results in the Hong</p>
<p>Kong Open tennis tournament on Saturday (prefix number denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>1-Michael Chang (U.S.) beat 4-Thomas Johansson (Sweden) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-5) 6-4</p>
<p>5-Patrick Rafter (Australia) beat Brian MacPhie (U.S.) 3-6 6-1</p>
<p>3-0, retired injured.</p>
</text>
